---
import DoodleStar from '@components/DoodleStar.astro';
import DoodleUnderline from '@components/DoodleUnderline.astro';
---

<section
    class="section overflow-hidden relative isolate border-t border-linen"
    aria-label="Vision and mission"
>
    <div
        class="purpose__doodle-star absolute -z-1 max-md:hidden"
        aria-hidden="true"
    >
        <DoodleStar />
    </div>
    <div class="shell">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-7 max-lg:block">
            <div
                class="col-span-5 col-start-2 max-lg:mb-10"
                data-scroll="left"
            >
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-charcoal">
                    <span
                        class="purpose__index"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                        01
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="purpose__label uppercase">Vision</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="purpose__vision font-display text-pretty">To bridge the worlds of science and art by adding a brush of <span class="inline-block relative whitespace-nowrap">human creativity<DoodleUnderline /></span> in scientific journals. We envision a future where young artists have opportunities to transform scientific research into visual stories that elevate academic communication.</p>
            </div>
            <div
                class="col-span-5 col-start-8 pt-18 max-lg:pt-0"
                data-scroll="right"
            >
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-charcoal">
                    <span
                        class="purpose__index"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                        02
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="purpose__label uppercase">Mission</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="purpose__mission text-pretty text-umber">At a time when AI-generated images are becoming increasingly common, our mission is to preserve human emotion through a collaboration between art and science. We provide students with opportunities to illustrate meaningful cover art while supporting journals that lack design resources. We strive to build a community where art and science can enhance each other, and students can continue their passions in interdisciplinary fields.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .purpose__doodle-star {
        height: clamp(40px, calc(26.67px + 4.17vw), 80px);
        left: 49%;
        opacity: 0.08;
        top: 42%;
        transform: translate(25%, -37.5%);
        width: clamp(40px, calc(26.67px + 4.17vw), 80px);
    }

    .purpose__index {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .purpose__label {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }

    .purpose__mission {
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .purpose__vision {
        font-size: clamp(19px, calc(16.33px + 0.83vw), 27px);
        font-weight: 430;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .purpose__doodle-star {
            height: clamp(40px, calc(-48.11px + 11.47vw), 69.37px);
            left: 72%;
            top: 49%;
            width: clamp(40px, calc(-48.11px + 11.47vw), 69.37px);
        }
    }
</style>
